{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】前湖北省委書記王忠林涉嫌嚴重違紀違法，接受中央紀委國家監委紀律審查和監察調查。</p>\n<p>64歲的王忠林早前在山東任職，在2020年新冠疫情期間接任武漢市委書記，第二年升任湖北省長，2024年再升任湖北省委書記，直至今年5月底卸任，之後擔任全國人大環境與資源保護委員會副主任。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:41:24.435882+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:34:57.924117+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:34:57.924117+00:00","content_hash":"f2ee862a1cb2e0f112b649206e3c09349ca918944cb7bca29789d97b1eaa0a34","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}